# Trial by Wind (battlefield.trial_by_wind): the requirement arms. Main, a level 75 Warrior with the quest accepted but no
# Tuning Fork of Wind: WP_Entrance: the key item check fails: no options: the default. bob, with the fork but the quest
# only available: BattlefieldQuest's check (accepted or more) fails: the default.
lists CloisterOfGales/WP_Entrance/onTrigger
char zone=CloisterOfGales pos=-357.6,-0.1,-380.0 job=WAR lvl=75
char bob zone=CloisterOfGales pos=-357.6,-0.1,-380.0 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Outlands.TrialByWind accepted
bob: keyitem TuningForkOfWind
login
trigger WP_Entrance                     # accepted, no fork: no options
bob: login
bob: trigger WP_Entrance                # the fork, available: no options
